-- title:
--   Actual original all-zero stopped clocks have exact five integrable zero witnesses and F below w(x)
-- statement:
--   Original spectrally negative infinite-activity stopped clock five-witness certificate with every original stopped clock identically zero. The actual source F uses the inclusive right-closed dividend Stieltjes measure and the exact right-limit initial dividend. By Proved original theorem avram_p4_f8_original_exact_clock_zero_reward_le_initial the stopped F value is pointwise at most w(x). All five martingale, generator and residual witnesses are the identically-zero integrable random variables, including mean-zero and zero-clock support. No Brownian/jump Ito assertion is made for positive times. This provides the genuine zero-clock branch for the mixed finite- and top-cap Ito decomposition.

